@startuml
title SD01 - Calculate customer discount (sales)
autonumber

actor "Sales employee" as V
participant "Order" as O
participant "Customer" as K
participant "CustomerDiscount" as D

V -> O: calculateTotalAmount()
activate O
O -> O: calculateOrderDiscount()
note right of O: Apply 5% order discount when subtotal >= EUR 500
O -> K: readApplicableCustomerDiscount()
K -> D: readPercentageForCurrentYear()
D --> K: percentage
K --> O: percentage
O -> O: calculateCustomerDiscount()
note right of O: 5%, 10% or 15% based on previous year's revenue (AD28)
O -> K: readOneTimeDiscountGranted()
K --> O: acquisitionIncentiveGranted
alt Incentive granted AND first order AND not previously applied
  O -> O: calculateOneTimeDiscount()
  note right of O: Extra 10% only for eligible acquisition incentive (AD21)
end
O -> O: calculateTotalAmount()
O --> V: totalAmount, appliedDiscounts
deactivate O
@enduml
